2&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AamF9cjkPeQQ7kNvwExrkze&_nc_oc=AdpO2bRAUcvdf7k-YtolsS9DH6f66zqLD4LOrGYoGgDRwJM61pkSOyb3DVfj6A4aY7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZj-_iFdgm6gkYG-vLwTs8CxQyk5gW8I5cnxH440pp3A&oe=6B01B8B9"}, "display_name": "Disc Benders: Ace Run", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Disc Benders is the ultimate Disc Golf simulator | Hone your disc throwing skills in challenging courses and relaxing environments\n\nNow boasts four full courses, with over 45+ holes to play, five unique disc types to choose from, and two game modes: Free Play & Career Mode\n\nReview your course play at the post-game review board, with career stats that carry across play sessions, and visualizations of your throws for your round.\n\nBend alongside up to 4 of your friends (and others) as you keep score and socialize on the course.\n\nFreshly designed 9-hole course 'Dream Drop Bends' will test your ability to throw flexes and high elevation shots, with pro-level distances\n\n\n*WARNING: Game is no longer in development - Experience is a finished product*", "short_description": "Disc Benders is the ultimate Disc Golf simulator | Hone your disc throwing skills in challenging courses and relaxing environments"}]}, "developer_name": "Free Fall Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://freefallstudiosgames.wixsite.com/discbenders/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Free Fall Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://freefallstudiosgames.wixsite.com/discbenders", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "CASUAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connect